# 📧 Inbox Management & Weekly Planning

## 🎯 Purpose
Start your week with clarity by having Microsoft Copilot analyze your backlog and create an action plan.

## 📊 Effectiveness Rating
**8/10** - Takes a few minutes to process across M365 tools, but delivers thorough, actionable results.

## 🔧 The Prompt Starts Here

Review all my emails and Teams messages from [previous month/period] and provide:

1. Quick Wins - Tasks I can complete this week to clear my backlog
2. Strategic Priorities - Important items requiring deep work or decisions
3. Waiting On Others - Items I've delegated or need follow-up from colleagues
4. Archive/Close - Conversations that are complete and can be closed

Then create a focused action plan for my first week back, highlighting the top 3 priorities that will have the biggest impact on my [current month] goals.

## 🔧 The Prompt Ends Here

## 🎓 4D Framework Application

- **Delegation**: Let AI sort and categorize your communications
- **Description**: Specific structure (Quick Wins, Priorities, etc.) ensures actionable output
- **Discernment**: Review AI suggestions before acting - you validate the categorization
- **Diligence**: Use weekly to build a sustainable productivity system

## ⚡ Expected Results

✅ Clear action plan for the week  
✅ Quick wins identified (typically 10-15 items)  
✅ Strategic priorities surfaced  
✅ Completed conversations archived with confidence  
✅ Time saved: 2-3 hours vs manual sorting

## 💡 Customization Tips

- **Adjust timeframe**: "from last week" / "from December 2025" / "from the past 30 days"
- **Focus areas**: Add "related to [project name]" to filter by topic
- **Urgency**: Add "prioritize by deadline" for time-sensitive work
- **Delegation**: Add "identify items to delegate to team" for managers

## 🔄 Recommended Frequency

- **Weekly**: Start of each week (Monday morning)
- **Post-vacation**: After any extended absence
- **Monthly**: First working day of each month

## 🛠️ Requirements

- Microsoft 365 subscription
- Microsoft Copilot license
- Access to Outlook and Teams

## 📈 Success Metrics

Track your results:
